            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Oleracimine and oleracimine A were isolated from Portulaca oleracea L. and described in the J. Agric. Food Chem, but the alternative structures of the two compounds are proposed on the basis of NMR analyses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
